description = "“But who will go to the school festival with me?!!!” asked Malachai.
Then Aurelia comes in (she’s the one that is canonical madly in love with malachai)
“I’ll go with you!”
Malachai stares in uncertainty
Then the Red haired Tsundere shows up. “Ughhh, i guess i’ll go with you, not like you were my first option……….baka.”
A few more girls come in and are jumping in desperation around Malachai.
Then a girl walks down the hallway and catches Malachai’s eye. She was the most beautiful thing he saw on the planet. “Who’s that?” Malachai asks
“Oh her?” says Tsundere. “She’s…”
BEEP BEEP BEEP The alarm clock goes off. Young Bethany wakes up from her desk after a long night of writing fanfic for INSERT ROMCOM ANIME NAME HERE. “Malachi is Mine!” Bethany exclaims

The miraculous Your Name fish does it again. Some believe she serves as a paradigm to fuel each individual's hopes and dreams, and Bethany drives ever closer to her goal. It seems that Malachai here will have to find other fish in the sea if Bethany is too late."
